# Keep build contexts small and keep secrets and private data out of images.
# A name matches only at the root of the context; **/ matches it in each folder. A worker that runs
# outside Docker keeps its state in apps/api/var and can read apps/api/.env
# (tests/deploy/test_build_context.py).
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
data
**/var
exports
backups
docs
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.claude
.DS_Store
